3bc3017c58f81</guid><source url="https://dev.to/jonie_rangel_051969a0f3fe/building-a-custom-html5-canvas-synced-video-engine-for-real-time-combat-dialogue-vetor-a-2987">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>独立服务器还是 VDS？给数据库、游戏服务器与 CI 的实用选型指南</title><link>https://dev.to/bigdomainhost/dedicated-server-or-vds-a-practical-way-to-decide-for-databases-game-servers-and-ci-56bp</link><description>从 CPU 波动、延迟抖动等实际症状出发，帮你判断游戏服务器到底该租独服还是带独占核心的 VDS。</description><pubDate>Sat, 14 Nov 2026 18:04:07 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">32ea8d2e6b7b439256f55cc33ace6ef139310675</guid><source url="https://dev.to/bigdomainhost/dedicated-server-or-vds-a-practical-way-to-decide-for-databases-game-servers-and-ci-56bp">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>用 10 行原生 JS 和 AI 提示词实现 60 FPS 粒子爆炸</title><link>https://dev.to/goutam_lambu_0a07d682a4ee/build-60-fps-particle-explosions-in-10-lines-of-vanilla-js-with-ai-prompts-4lh4</link><description>这篇教程展示如何用 HTML5 Canvas 加 AI 提示词工作流，只用 10 行代码做出流畅的 60 FPS 粒子爆炸效果。</description><pubDate>Sat, 14 Nov 2026 18:55:05 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">11c80ae821eb1a70a3dae354058eea5dddeef7c4</guid><source url="https://dev.to/goutam_lambu_0a07d682a4ee/build-60-fps-particle-explosions-in-10-lines-of-vanilla-js-with-ai-prompts-4lh4">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>我做了 10 个 Windows 小工具，专治独立游戏开发里的枯燥杂活</title><link>https://dev.to/guillaumelessard/i-built-10-tiny-windows-tools-for-the-boring-parts-of-indie-gamedev-47pf</link><description>针对每届 game jam 都要重复的杂活——批量改图、切图集、打图集、做音效——作者各做了一个小工具，打包成套，独立开发者可以直接拿来省时间。</description><pubDate>Sat, 14 Nov 2026 19:44:33 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">37c3308304de556923951d53ab8dc3d5edd8783d</guid><source url="https://dev.to/guillaumelessard/i-built-10-tiny-windows-tools-for-the-boring-parts-of-indie-gamedev-47pf">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>《Blind Sight: Dead World》安卓试玩版：小体量僵尸生存游戏的设计课</title><link>https://dev.to/trendzbetagames/blind-sight-dead-world-demo-on-android-design-lessons-from-a-tiny-zombie-survival-game-57eb</link><description>一款第一人称僵尸生存试玩版只靠搜刮、防御、逃离三个机制成局，作者拆解了它如何用资源稀缺逼玩家做取舍，小团队做 Demo 可以照着学。</description><pubDate>Sat, 14 Nov 2026 19:35:14 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">90ad3d36373ab5d9583c62190f5d361460af2dee</guid><source url="https://dev.to/trendzbetagames/blind-sight-dead-world-demo-on-android-design-lessons-from-a-tiny-zombie-survival-game-57eb">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>Unreal Engine 5.4 建筑可视化优化：Draw Call 从 10000 压到 1200 以下</title><link>https://dev.to/atlyxen_studios/unreal-engine-54-archviz-optimization-slashing-draw-calls-from-10000-to-under-1200-mk9</link><description>从 Revit 等软件导出的建筑模型动辄上万次 Draw Call，作者用分层实例化静态网格批量合并重复构件，实测把大型场景稳定在 60 帧。</description><pubDate>Sat, 14 Nov 2026 20:16:41 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">572d9fe3bb6fd46ddcb8f7bdd547f624d82eefac</guid><source url="https://dev.to/atlyxen_studios/unreal-engine-54-archviz-optimization-slashing-draw-calls-from-10000-to-under-1200-mk9">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>开发日志：做《NICHLYST》——敞开的门：33 个结局、32 项测试全过与一个诚实的保留意见</title><link>https://dev.to/koztechie/building-nichlyst-the-gate-that-stayed-open-33-endings-32-green-tests-one-honest-caveat-159b</link><description>作者在修好 704 个失败断言后，用一连串小而窄的检查验证了 33 个结局与双语字段等细节，最后坦言：阶段关卡虽全过，但设备端已知的启动报错仍未实测排除，绿色测试只证明它所证明的东西。</description><pubDate>Sat, 14 Nov 2026 21:23:40 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">d3b515350460890c97483bbe3593673b1907ce73</guid><source url="https://dev.to/koztechie/building-nichlyst-the-gate-that-stayed-open-33-endings-32-green-tests-one-honest-caveat-159b">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>Clannect Engine v0.2 发布：向开源迈出重要一步</title><link>https://dev.to/yigitdemirci/clannect-engine-v02-is-here-a-major-step-towards-open-release-2p6c</link><description>Clannect Engine 迎来 v0.2 版本，在走向开源的路上又迈出关键一步，值得关注小型引擎的开发者留意它的进展。</description><pubDate>Sat, 14 Nov 2026 23:38:25 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">1617a81b3cb30bb5b5cd9a6ca5b5fce00e6befd0</guid><source url="https://dev.to/yigitdemirci/clannect-engine-v02-is-here-a-major-step-towards-open-release-2p6c">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>藏在 README 里的二十一点牌桌，由 GitHub Actions 发牌</title><link>https://dev.to/kanywst/a-blackjack-table-that-lives-in-a-readme-dealt-by-github-actions-5g63</link><description>用 issue 下注、workflow 读牌、README 重绘牌面，把经典的 README 小游戏玩法搬到了二十一点上。</description><pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 00:45:48 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">f979d3112aaa54861723cacbb179affcef2d8206</guid><source url="https://dev.to/kanywst/a-blackjack-table-that-lives-in-a-readme-dealt-by-github-actions-5g63">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>Roblox Studio 新 Beta：用文字提示生成 R15 动画，还能把旧 R6 动画转成 R15</title><link>https://dev.to/tora_scripts/roblox-dropped-a-studio-beta-that-generates-r15-animations-from-text-prompts-and-converts-old-r6-13og</link><description>Roblox 在 Studio Assistant 里上线了文字生成动画的 Beta 功能：输入动作与情绪描述即可生成最长 10 秒的 R15 人形动画，还能用神经网络把旧 R6 动画升级为 R15，适合不想从零手 K 关键帧的独立开发者。</description><pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 05:25:38 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">e75f7e9f19ff2aa99dc815e801e130b1094469d9</guid><source url="https://dev.to/tora_scripts/roblox-dropped-a-studio-beta-that-generates-r15-animations-from-text-prompts-and-converts-old-r6-13og">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>用 Rive 打造游戏化健身吉祥物：开发者指南</title><link>https://dev.to/uianimation/how-to-build-a-gamified-fitness-mascot-with-rive-a-developers-guide-45hp</link><description>这篇教程讲如何用 Rive 状态机做一只会随进度进化、对锻炼做出反应的互动健身吉祥物，并给出 React Native 与 Flutter 的接入做法。</description><pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 07:45:23 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">6dae86aed95865dd5711080c208c3a0a4ac3efd6</guid><source url="https://dev.to/uianimation/how-to-build-a-gamified-fitness-mascot-with-rive-a-developers-guide-45hp">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>我们如何让 Telegram 小游戏的战斗确定化且由服务器校验</title><link>https://dev.to/codiologism/how-we-made-battles-deterministic-and-server-verified-in-a-telegram-mini-game-26l2</link><description>Seraph Legion 团队分享了他们在 Telegram 小程序里实现确定性战斗的做法：客户端只发意图、服务器决定结果并重放校验，起因是一次刷资源漏洞让他们意识到绝不能信任客户端计算。</description><pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 09:52:25 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">09e2ce0ebab304ae72ce022ed516eb1df1b2303c</guid><source url="https://dev.to/codiologism/how-we-made-battles-deterministic-and-server-verified-in-a-telegram-mini-game-26l2">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>寻宝类应用的位置隐私：该收集什么、该删什么、绝不能记录什么</title><link>https://dev.to/samellis/location-privacy-in-a-scavenger-hunt-app-what-to-collect-what-to-delete-and-what-never-to-log-29k5</link><description>寻宝游戏每句“往北走 40 米”背后都是玩家的位置轨迹，这篇拆解了这类应用该收哪些数据、该删哪些、哪些打死也不能记。</description><pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 11:55:50 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">7e2aa75b08c62fd1669535dd6a87cd1ba95e8e29</guid><source url="https://dev.to/samellis/location-privacy-in-a-scavenger-hunt-app-what-to-collect-what-to-delete-and-what-never-to-log-29k5">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>设计一款断网也能玩的位置游戏</title><link>https://dev.to/samellis/designing-a-location-game-that-keeps-working-when-the-phone-has-no-signal-4hkb</link><description>一篇实战总结，讲位置类游戏如何摆脱对服务器的依赖，在手机断网时依然能正常游玩。</description><pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 12:57:36 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">5818bf5ddfd5066f0705e359b4ff95ae4f173f49</guid><source url="https://dev.to/samellis/designing-a-location-game-that-keeps-working-when-the-phone-has-no-signal-4hkb">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item></channel></rss>
